WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 30=

01:54.300 --> 01:56.420
Your Highness,
Attendant Liu from the palace is here.

01:57.380 --> 01:57.900
Liu Wenji?

01:58.940 --> 01:59.300
Show him in.

01:59.700 --> 02:00.300
Show him in.

02:00.300 --> 02:00.660
Yes.

02:05.260 --> 02:05.820
Sir.

02:06.860 --> 02:07.140
Please.

02:08.060 --> 02:09.020
Bring out the finest tea.

02:09.220 --> 02:09.580
Yes.

02:10.940 --> 02:11.260
Please.

02:21.100 --> 02:22.340
Sir, you must be swamped with affairs.

02:23.220 --> 02:24.620
Do you have any news

02:25.460 --> 02:26.420
about my father?

02:31.740 --> 02:32.100
Your Highness.

02:33.260 --> 02:34.580
The Yu case has been
under review for a long time.

02:35.100 --> 02:35.980
It implicates many.

02:37.060 --> 02:38.380
It's really hard to handle.

02:39.020 --> 02:41.260
Besides, my words carry little weight.

02:41.660 --> 02:44.340
I'm lucky to catch
a scrap of it before His Majesty.

02:45.140 --> 02:46.620
How would I dare guess
at His Majesty's mind?

02:47.780 --> 02:48.860
A scrap from you

02:48.860 --> 02:50.420
is a lifeline for my whole family.

02:51.260 --> 02:52.180
Please, for the sake

02:52.780 --> 02:53.820
of the Prince of Jin,

02:54.460 --> 02:55.380
give me a straight answer.

02:59.700 --> 03:00.220
Confiscation?

03:04.740 --> 03:05.100
Hurry!

03:05.820 --> 03:07.140
Bring my rosewood box
with mother-of-pearl inlay.

03:07.500 --> 03:07.980
Yes.

03:24.780 --> 03:26.020
A small token from me.

03:28.060 --> 03:28.860
Please, sir,

03:30.260 --> 03:30.900
tell me what I should do.

03:41.740 --> 03:42.220
Your Highness.

03:43.260 --> 03:45.740
Some rumors don't arise

03:48.020 --> 03:48.980
out of thin air.

03:52.980 --> 03:53.780
Please put in a good word

03:54.100 --> 03:56.060
for the Liang family
before His Majesty, sir.

03:57.140 --> 03:58.780
It's not about putting in a good word.

04:00.500 --> 04:02.460
Minister Liang is caught up
in the Yu faction case.

04:02.860 --> 04:04.940
Confiscation is the least
of what could happen.

04:06.020 --> 04:07.020
We must await His Majesty's decision.

04:20.420 --> 04:20.900
Your Highness.

04:21.940 --> 04:22.620
I am

04:23.140 --> 04:25.940
only taking this risk to warn you

04:26.740 --> 04:29.140
out of respect for your filial devotion.

04:30.020 --> 04:31.620
After all, he's your father.

04:32.540 --> 04:33.180
You

04:36.460 --> 04:37.900
should prepare yourself.

05:00.020 --> 05:00.900
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

05:00.900 --> 05:01.420
Your Highness.

05:02.580 --> 05:03.100
Your Highness!

05:04.420 --> 05:06.500
For the sake of our marriage,

05:06.980 --> 05:07.540
please save me.

05:08.460 --> 05:09.220
Your Highness!

05:10.140 --> 05:10.860
Your Highness.

05:11.820 --> 05:14.140
For the sake of our marriage,

05:14.820 --> 05:15.460
please save me.

05:16.180 --> 05:17.060
Your Highness.

05:18.140 --> 05:20.340
Your Highness, say something.

05:22.100 --> 05:22.540
Your Highness.

05:23.700 --> 05:24.020
Your...

05:29.940 --> 05:30.900
Your Highness.

05:31.580 --> 05:32.500
Say something.

05:34.540 --> 05:35.300
Your Highness!

05:37.060 --> 05:38.340
Say something, Your Highness.

05:38.620 --> 05:39.460
Your Highness.

05:47.540 --> 05:47.900
(Your Highness,)

05:49.020 --> 05:49.940
(the Yu faction's treason)

05:50.580 --> 05:52.060
(is a crime beyond forgiveness.)

05:52.060 --> 05:52.860
Your Highness.

05:53.580 --> 05:54.580
(These days,)

05:55.260 --> 05:56.860
(no one involved in this case)

05:57.820 --> 05:59.020
(has met a good end.)

06:00.700 --> 06:02.260
(I'm sure I don't need to spell it out.)

06:08.420 --> 06:15.300
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

06:30.540 --> 06:32.700
I never cared for your affection.

06:35.460 --> 06:36.940
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)
I never thought much

06:38.260 --> 06:40.380
of this residence or you!

06:42.780 --> 06:44.060
I

06:45.300 --> 06:46.540
was born noble

06:47.940 --> 06:48.900
and lived with dignity.

06:50.260 --> 06:52.580
Yet I was married off here,
only to be humiliated by you!

06:54.340 --> 06:55.780
You wretch.

06:57.620 --> 06:59.060
You wretch!

07:08.940 --> 07:12.700
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

08:19.260 --> 08:21.220
I waited all these years
for you to come.

08:23.500 --> 08:25.900
But I won't even get to hear

08:27.620 --> 08:28.700
you call me Mother

08:31.100 --> 08:32.260
before

08:33.740 --> 08:34.820
we part.

08:57.020 --> 08:58.980
Rather than be deposed, divorced,

09:00.060 --> 09:01.700
and trampled into the dirt,

09:03.660 --> 09:04.500
I might as well

09:04.500 --> 09:06.700
choose a dignified end

09:09.860 --> 09:12.020
while you still call me Your Highness.

09:35.820 --> 09:40.500
(The bearer of this is my trusted man.
Follow Yang Si's orders in all matters.)

09:46.340 --> 09:47.420
(This is the Crown Prince's token.)

09:48.460 --> 09:48.940
(Lately,)

09:49.860 --> 09:50.860
(has there been an envoy)

09:50.860 --> 09:52.220
(probing into your dealings
with the Crown Prince?)

09:52.940 --> 09:53.860
(His name is Yan Shang.)

09:54.900 --> 09:55.580
(Military Commander, rest assured.)

09:56.060 --> 09:56.980
(He's one
of the Crown Prince's men too.)

10:02.900 --> 10:04.020
Did you see clearly?

10:04.740 --> 10:06.780
This is the Crown Prince's handwriting
and seal.

10:07.740 --> 10:08.900
I'm the Crown Prince's real messenger.

10:10.340 --> 10:10.740
But...

10:11.820 --> 10:13.060
But Yan Shang has already...

10:18.340 --> 10:19.140
How much does he know?

10:24.260 --> 10:25.140
He knows everything?

10:29.580 --> 10:30.260
And the records?

10:31.780 --> 10:32.220
He...

10:34.780 --> 10:35.540
has seen them all.

11:17.500 --> 11:17.900
What's wrong?

11:20.420 --> 11:21.700
Hoofbeats are approaching.

11:22.940 --> 11:23.700
Horses moving that fast

11:24.460 --> 11:25.540
aren't privately owned.

11:32.820 --> 11:33.420
Take another road!

11:33.660 --> 11:34.100
Turn left.

11:35.700 --> 11:36.220
Left!

11:37.020 --> 11:37.460
What?

11:44.140 --> 11:44.820
This coachman is up to something!

11:45.180 --> 11:45.620
Hold on tight!

13:32.140 --> 13:33.860
So you're
the Crown Prince's backup plan.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.140
Yan Shang.

13:39.500 --> 13:39.900
Let's go.

13:59.220 --> 13:59.700
Yan Shang.

14:01.140 --> 14:01.700
Your Highness.

14:09.940 --> 14:10.460
Yan Shang.

14:11.860 --> 14:12.340
Yan Shang.

14:13.020 --> 14:13.580
Look at me

14:15.300 --> 14:16.060
Your Highness.

14:18.580 --> 14:19.940
A normal arrow wound
wouldn't be like this.

14:20.460 --> 14:21.300
Something's wrong with this arrow.

14:22.180 --> 14:22.820
Bear with it.

14:36.860 --> 14:37.340
Yan Shang.

14:39.060 --> 14:39.500
Yan Shang.

14:40.140 --> 14:40.580
Yan Shang.

14:43.140 --> 14:43.700
Your Highness.

14:43.700 --> 14:44.180
What kind of poison

14:44.740 --> 14:45.780
do you think this is?

14:48.260 --> 14:48.860
I

14:51.060 --> 14:52.740
don't know.

14:53.180 --> 14:53.980
This is Lingnan.

14:54.420 --> 14:55.900
How can there be anything
you don't know?

14:58.580 --> 14:59.260
Your Highness,

15:00.660 --> 15:02.140
I'm a scholar,

15:03.700 --> 15:05.300
not a hunter.

15:21.940 --> 15:22.500
Bite it.

15:49.380 --> 15:49.820
Yan Shang.

15:50.300 --> 15:50.740
Yan Shang.

16:03.260 --> 16:03.780
Yan Shang.

16:06.780 --> 16:07.260
Yan Shang.

16:09.580 --> 16:10.060
Yan Shang.

16:10.700 --> 16:11.300
Wake up.

16:20.500 --> 16:21.500
I'm

16:22.620 --> 16:23.780
useless.

16:24.900 --> 16:25.620
I actually

16:27.060 --> 16:28.380
passed out from the pain.

16:28.820 --> 16:29.820
You've been poisoned.

16:35.300 --> 16:36.020
Your Highness.

16:37.420 --> 16:37.860
I

16:39.860 --> 16:41.180
can't walk.

16:46.740 --> 16:47.900
Listen to me.

16:49.660 --> 16:50.060
You...

16:50.780 --> 16:51.700
You get out of here.

16:53.780 --> 16:55.140
Come back for me

16:56.780 --> 16:57.660
once

16:59.580 --> 17:00.380
you're safe.

17:00.380 --> 17:01.060
Stop talking nonsense.

17:02.460 --> 17:02.780
Let's go.

17:02.780 --> 17:05.780
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

17:07.980 --> 17:13.260
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

17:15.260 --> 17:15.980
Wanyao.

17:17.380 --> 17:18.580
It's raining.

17:21.060 --> 17:21.860
It's just dew.

17:24.260 --> 17:25.060
If it rains,

17:25.500 --> 17:26.140
we're in trouble.

17:27.300 --> 17:27.900
It's

17:29.460 --> 17:30.860
much colder tonight than the night

17:31.620 --> 17:32.500
you carried me.

17:36.940 --> 17:37.460
I

17:38.660 --> 17:39.460
am not cold.

17:41.180 --> 17:41.740
And

17:42.940 --> 17:44.140
I'm not in pain.

17:45.100 --> 17:45.780
You fool.

17:47.140 --> 17:48.420
I know what it feels like to bleed.

17:48.420 --> 17:51.780
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

17:51.860 --> 17:56.860
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

17:57.220 --> 17:57.900
Yan Shang.

17:59.220 --> 17:59.940
What mountain

18:02.540 --> 18:03.620
is this?

18:06.060 --> 18:07.100
And what kind of trees

18:09.380 --> 18:10.420
are these?

18:11.580 --> 18:15.020
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

18:15.140 --> 18:18.260
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

18:18.260 --> 18:18.980
Answer me.

18:21.580 --> 18:22.700
I won't let you fall asleep.

18:25.900 --> 18:26.420
Yan Shang.

18:26.420 --> 18:27.820
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

18:27.820 --> 18:29.820
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

18:29.820 --> 18:30.260
Yan Shang.

18:30.500 --> 18:33.060
♪You're the only one I need♪

18:33.340 --> 18:33.940
Yan Shang.

18:36.700 --> 18:37.780
So many

18:39.300 --> 18:40.620
pine trees.

18:40.620 --> 18:42.620
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

18:42.620 --> 18:43.500
Just like

18:44.580 --> 18:46.700
the estate you gave me.

18:49.460 --> 18:50.020
When

18:51.460 --> 18:53.660
are we going back?

18:55.900 --> 18:57.020
I'll get you back. I promise.

19:10.500 --> 19:11.260
A few of you, search over there!

19:11.940 --> 19:13.140
Search every inch!

19:15.860 --> 19:16.340
Check over there!

19:18.060 --> 19:18.780
Something over here!

19:20.500 --> 19:20.820
Sir!

19:26.420 --> 19:26.780
Sir.

19:28.180 --> 19:29.100
We found bloodstains over here.

19:29.420 --> 19:29.780
Search the mountain.

19:30.940 --> 19:31.260
Yes!

19:32.420 --> 19:32.900
Search the mountain!

19:33.220 --> 19:33.940
Yes!

19:38.700 --> 19:39.580
Search carefully!

19:40.540 --> 19:40.860
Got it!

19:41.820 --> 19:42.900
A few of you, come check over here!

19:58.460 --> 19:59.140
Check over there!

20:00.140 --> 20:00.420
Move!

20:26.300 --> 20:27.500
How did you end up like this?

20:28.940 --> 20:30.740
Is this his blood or yours?

20:31.500 --> 20:32.100
Yu Niang is dead.

20:33.900 --> 20:34.420
I killed her.

20:35.060 --> 20:35.620
You?

20:38.020 --> 20:38.380
Wait,

20:38.940 --> 20:39.900
why was she here?

20:40.260 --> 20:41.540
Because my dear brother,

20:42.660 --> 20:43.340
the Crown Prince,

20:44.100 --> 20:44.980
doesn't trust you.

20:52.780 --> 20:54.140
Wanyao, how could you kill someone?

20:54.660 --> 20:55.220
Surprised?

20:55.780 --> 20:56.860
It's not my first time.

20:58.700 --> 20:59.220
Yang Si,

21:00.820 --> 21:01.860
you really don't know me.

21:03.580 --> 21:04.460
She was going to kill Yan Shang.

21:05.140 --> 21:06.060
I had no choice.

21:06.900 --> 21:07.620
If it had been me,

21:09.140 --> 21:09.780
would you have killed me too?

21:12.380 --> 21:12.700
Yes.

21:23.580 --> 21:23.980
Yan Shang.

21:35.780 --> 21:36.460
You're finally awake.

21:37.420 --> 21:39.340
You were as cold as ice just now.

22:04.900 --> 22:05.900
I really am

22:06.180 --> 22:07.740
the most forgiving person alive.

22:10.220 --> 22:12.060
You all know who wants to
mess with Lingnan's officials.

22:12.740 --> 22:13.700
Killing Yan Shang

22:13.980 --> 22:15.300
won't let you rest easy.

22:16.060 --> 22:17.500
If anything happens to Yan Shang,

22:18.260 --> 22:20.220
Xun and I will become sworn enemies.

22:20.580 --> 22:22.140
My job is to protect the Crown Prince.

22:23.140 --> 22:23.980
Your business with him

22:24.420 --> 22:24.900
isn't my concern.

22:28.620 --> 22:30.460
Yan Shang, you should know

22:30.980 --> 22:32.460
what a storm those findings of yours
in Lingnan

22:32.660 --> 22:33.580
will cause

22:33.660 --> 22:34.660
if they reach His Majesty's ears.

22:35.860 --> 22:37.300
You've seen what His Majesty is like.

22:38.220 --> 22:40.180
Don't think you and Wanyao
will get away unscathed.

22:42.340 --> 22:42.860
Cat got your tongue?

22:43.380 --> 22:44.100
Gone dumb?

22:44.780 --> 22:45.300
Good.

22:46.020 --> 22:47.100
That's how you'll make it back

22:47.180 --> 22:48.060
to Sheng'an alive.

22:48.420 --> 22:49.260
Shut up, Yang Si!

22:50.300 --> 22:51.420
He's barely hanging on.

22:51.820 --> 22:53.140
It's a miracle
if he makes it back alive.

22:53.540 --> 22:53.860
I...

22:59.460 --> 23:00.260
He's burning up.

23:01.100 --> 23:02.900
It probably isn't safe
to seek medical help here.

23:03.500 --> 23:04.660
How much longer
till we're out of Lingnan?

23:04.980 --> 23:05.460
Around midnight.

23:05.980 --> 23:07.420
We won't find a physician
until tomorrow morning.

23:08.700 --> 23:09.220
Hang in there.

23:16.700 --> 23:20.500
(Hongfu Inn)

23:28.660 --> 23:29.620
It's poison spider vine.

23:30.660 --> 23:31.380
How did he

23:32.420 --> 23:33.660
get poisoned with that?

23:35.380 --> 23:36.100
Got accidentally hit

23:36.780 --> 23:38.020
by a hunter while gathering herbs.

23:39.940 --> 23:40.580
What about this poison?

23:41.740 --> 23:42.580
Is his life in danger?

23:44.220 --> 23:45.020
Well...

23:45.620 --> 23:46.220
Can he be saved?

23:47.580 --> 23:48.620
Or tell me who can save him.

23:49.620 --> 23:50.580
Yes, he can be saved.

23:51.500 --> 23:54.660
Arrows laced with this poison
are deadly.

23:55.660 --> 23:56.940
But he's lucky.

23:57.340 --> 23:58.980
Thanks to your quick treatment,

23:59.340 --> 24:00.860
he just needs medication now.

24:01.740 --> 24:02.460
He should

24:02.980 --> 24:04.220
be out of danger.

24:04.660 --> 24:05.860
Please go prepare the prescription.

24:06.780 --> 24:07.540
Yes.

24:14.700 --> 24:15.340
Wanyao.

24:21.100 --> 24:21.740
Wanyao.

24:34.980 --> 24:35.700
How are you feeling?

24:39.500 --> 24:40.420
Wanyao.

25:28.940 --> 25:29.300
Wanyao.

25:30.060 --> 25:30.500
Come out here.

25:46.220 --> 25:46.820
Is he out of danger?

25:49.220 --> 25:49.860
Changed your mind?

25:51.980 --> 25:52.860
You'd better talk some sense into him.

25:53.540 --> 25:54.620
If he doesn't want to drag you down,

25:55.020 --> 25:55.900
he'd better keep his mouth shut forever.

25:56.020 --> 25:56.780
I will.

25:57.700 --> 25:58.700
But you should know

25:59.100 --> 26:00.100
that Yan Shang isn't the only one

26:00.540 --> 26:01.500
who knows the Crown Prince's secrets.

26:01.940 --> 26:02.540
I know them too.

26:03.540 --> 26:05.460
Killing just him won't be enough.

26:19.220 --> 26:19.780
Sir.

26:25.820 --> 26:26.900
I'm from Lingnan.

26:27.940 --> 26:29.380
I've heard of poison spider vine.

26:30.740 --> 26:31.420
I know

26:32.260 --> 26:33.340
that my surviving

26:34.260 --> 26:36.540
proves your exceptional skill.

26:37.980 --> 26:38.740
The rest

26:40.140 --> 26:41.740
is beyond human power.

26:42.700 --> 26:43.740
It'll be up to fate.

26:44.700 --> 26:45.220
So

26:46.580 --> 26:47.740
please,

26:48.540 --> 26:49.540
tell me everything you know.

26:51.060 --> 26:52.300
Do you realize
that if anything goes wrong,

26:52.780 --> 26:54.180
the lives of everyone
in the Eastern Palace

26:54.420 --> 26:55.820
will be on my shoulders?

26:55.820 --> 26:56.300
Yang Si.

26:57.660 --> 26:58.500
I want him

26:59.100 --> 27:00.420
to keep his mouth shut more than you do.

27:30.620 --> 27:33.060
Poison spider vine
is the most venomous plant

27:33.620 --> 27:34.820
in the mountains of Lingnan.

27:35.820 --> 27:37.620
Nine out of ten who are poisoned die.

27:38.380 --> 27:39.340
Even those who survive

27:39.980 --> 27:41.060
may go blind,

27:41.620 --> 27:42.700
deaf,

27:43.380 --> 27:44.700
or become paralyzed.

27:45.180 --> 27:46.900
They are all left incapacitated.

27:51.740 --> 27:53.060
How long can I keep it from her?

27:56.420 --> 27:58.140
Ten days at most

27:59.020 --> 28:00.340
before the poison takes effect.

28:05.380 --> 28:06.060
That'll be enough.

28:11.460 --> 28:12.180
Get some more sleep.

28:13.340 --> 28:14.180
I'll stay here with you.

28:18.260 --> 28:19.580
I want to look at you a while longer.

28:28.180 --> 28:32.380
(Blessings in Harmony with Time)

28:44.940 --> 28:45.780
How could

28:47.460 --> 28:49.020
Her Highness suddenly take her own life?

28:53.220 --> 28:53.940
Greetings, Your Highness.

29:01.140 --> 29:02.140
His Highness says

29:02.420 --> 29:03.700
that now that
the Princess Consort has passed,

29:03.980 --> 29:06.180
you should raise the child.

29:36.180 --> 29:36.660
Wenji?

29:38.260 --> 29:38.900
What brings you here?

29:39.260 --> 29:40.180
I'm here on imperial order

29:41.100 --> 29:42.660
to deliver funeral funds
for the Princess Consort of Jin.

29:58.380 --> 29:59.100
The child is back now.

30:00.100 --> 30:00.540
Chunhua,

30:02.180 --> 30:02.700
are you happy?

30:14.300 --> 30:14.940
From now on,

30:15.900 --> 30:17.100
no one will threaten you anymore.

30:19.260 --> 30:19.940
And you won't have to cry...

30:37.180 --> 30:37.820
It was you?

30:41.620 --> 30:41.940
Yes.

30:45.060 --> 30:46.420
I'm finally

30:49.220 --> 30:51.100
not useless anymore.

31:35.300 --> 31:36.940
I slipped out of the military governor's
residence and headed out of the city.

31:37.540 --> 31:38.380
I searched everywhere.
When I couldn't find you,

31:38.700 --> 31:39.900
I figured you'd already gone north.

31:40.500 --> 31:41.860
You sure move fast, Your Highness.

31:42.100 --> 31:43.220
Good thing you found us.

31:44.340 --> 31:44.980
Look who you're dealing with.

31:49.060 --> 31:49.580
You're awake.

31:56.740 --> 31:57.420
Should we slow down?

31:57.900 --> 31:58.660
Is it too bumpy?

31:59.180 --> 32:00.700
Fang Tong! Faster!

32:06.660 --> 32:07.140
No need.

32:08.020 --> 32:08.620
I'm fine.

32:12.140 --> 32:12.900
Where are we?

32:13.580 --> 32:14.540
Lantian is just ahead.

32:14.900 --> 32:15.620
Almost back in Sheng'an.

32:18.060 --> 32:18.460
Good.

32:30.620 --> 32:33.940
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

32:37.260 --> 32:37.620
Easy.

32:41.460 --> 32:42.900
Your Highness,
someone from the palace is here.

32:43.100 --> 32:44.980
They've been waiting here for days.

32:49.100 --> 32:50.580
By His Majesty's command.

32:51.500 --> 32:51.980
Yan Shang.

32:56.100 --> 32:58.260
How did your work in Lingnan go?

33:06.740 --> 33:07.220
Mr. Yan?

33:08.420 --> 33:09.620
How's the disaster relief?

33:09.940 --> 33:11.860
How's the inspection of funds and grain
along the Lingnan circuit?

33:12.260 --> 33:13.940
What did you see
on your trip to Lingnan?

33:14.460 --> 33:15.100
Do you have a report?

33:16.220 --> 33:16.940
Please tell His Majesty...

33:16.940 --> 33:19.140
His Majesty asked Mr. Yan,

33:19.340 --> 33:20.780
not you, Your Highness.

33:23.580 --> 33:24.340
Your Majesty,

33:25.540 --> 33:26.380
I've failed.

33:26.980 --> 33:28.140
I've let you down.

33:28.580 --> 33:29.340
Relief efforts fell short.

33:30.100 --> 33:31.420
And the inspection turned up nothing.

33:32.140 --> 33:33.260
I couldn't ease your burden.

33:33.780 --> 33:34.300
I deserve

33:34.900 --> 33:35.940
death.

33:42.460 --> 33:43.060
Mr. Yan.

33:43.700 --> 33:44.500
That doesn't add up.

33:46.060 --> 33:47.300
What does His Majesty intend to do
with him?

33:47.740 --> 33:48.500
Princess Danyang,

33:50.020 --> 33:51.020
he won't be staying

33:51.900 --> 33:52.860
in such a fine residence anymore.

33:54.860 --> 33:56.700
His Majesty gave orders.

33:57.220 --> 33:59.900
If Mr. Yan returns
with nothing to report,

34:00.260 --> 34:01.620
he'll go straight
to the Imperial Prison.

34:05.300 --> 34:05.820
Mr. Yan.

34:06.740 --> 34:07.140
Please.

34:33.740 --> 34:34.220
It's all right.

34:59.860 --> 35:00.940
I saved you once.

35:02.580 --> 35:03.660
I can save you again.

35:06.060 --> 35:06.580
Yan Shang.

35:08.700 --> 35:10.220
There's no obstacle I can't overcome.

35:14.700 --> 35:15.980
Yu Niang served me faithfully

35:16.980 --> 35:17.860
for years.

35:18.660 --> 35:19.900
Now the Eastern Palace

35:20.220 --> 35:21.300
is in greater danger than ever.

35:22.340 --> 35:23.540
And yet she fell in Lingnan.

35:28.260 --> 35:28.980
Yan Shang

35:30.060 --> 35:31.300
knows when to fold.

35:31.900 --> 35:32.860
He said nothing

35:33.620 --> 35:34.500
and went to prison.

35:38.300 --> 35:39.940
Do you still think
I should have him silenced?

35:41.580 --> 35:42.660
He's been unconscious for days.

35:43.140 --> 35:44.100
I went through everything carefully.

35:44.780 --> 35:46.340
He brought nothing back from Lingnan.

35:47.060 --> 35:48.140
He barely escaped with his life.

35:48.580 --> 35:49.340
Words prove nothing.

35:50.860 --> 35:52.020
I'm not blaming you.

35:52.260 --> 35:54.060
But I've never seen you look this bad.

35:55.780 --> 35:56.540
Have you thought about it?

35:57.460 --> 35:58.660
Even if he keeps his mouth shut,

35:59.540 --> 35:59.980
His Majesty

36:00.500 --> 36:01.620
has probably figured out most of it.

36:02.020 --> 36:02.820
I thought the same.

36:03.340 --> 36:03.860
This matter

36:04.780 --> 36:05.980
is known not just to Yan Shang

36:06.420 --> 36:07.100
and Wanyao.

36:07.420 --> 36:07.980
His Majesty

36:08.580 --> 36:10.220
surely has some inkling too.

36:11.180 --> 36:12.220
But without proof,

36:12.980 --> 36:13.620
what can he do?

36:14.940 --> 36:16.500
You're the Crown Prince of Huai,
after all.

36:19.820 --> 36:20.820
What is a Crown Prince?

36:22.500 --> 36:24.300
Just an heir
who holds His Majesty's favor.

36:25.020 --> 36:25.580
It could be me,

36:27.340 --> 36:28.660
and it could be anyone at any moment.

36:29.660 --> 36:30.820
If His Majesty's favor ever shifts,

36:31.380 --> 36:32.220
the heir's seat

36:33.220 --> 36:34.100
and the Eastern Palace

36:35.100 --> 36:36.420
could be overturned in an instant.

36:40.500 --> 36:41.580
While you were in Lingnan,

36:42.580 --> 36:44.100
I spent every waking moment

36:44.660 --> 36:45.860
thinking about the same thing.

36:46.540 --> 36:48.020
Ever since His Majesty confined us

36:48.660 --> 36:49.580
and sent Yan Shang south,

36:50.580 --> 36:51.260
he'd already made up

36:51.740 --> 36:52.660
his mind.

36:53.220 --> 36:54.700
We should never have held onto hope.

36:56.020 --> 36:56.980
Rather than live in fear,

36:57.260 --> 36:57.860
waiting

36:58.140 --> 36:59.140
and guessing,

37:01.660 --> 37:02.300
we might as well...

38:17.940 --> 38:18.380
Shang.

38:19.060 --> 38:20.500
You can start scattering the seeds.

38:20.500 --> 38:20.820
Okay.

38:26.260 --> 38:27.380
I found lots of wild greens!

38:27.620 --> 38:28.660
We'll have something to eat tonight.

38:29.020 --> 38:29.660
Xiaozhou, you're here.

38:32.340 --> 38:32.700
What is it?

38:36.340 --> 38:37.060
What's so funny?

38:38.500 --> 38:39.020
Shang,

38:39.340 --> 38:40.940
you two just aren't cut out for farming.

38:41.740 --> 38:43.380
The furrows are all crooked.

38:43.500 --> 38:44.980
And the seeds are scattered
way too thin.

38:46.660 --> 38:47.420
Let me do it.

38:47.540 --> 38:47.860
Don't bother.

38:48.500 --> 38:49.220
Just show us how.

38:56.140 --> 38:56.660
Forget it.

38:57.860 --> 38:58.780
Let's just plant what we can.

38:59.580 --> 39:01.380
Anyway, we might not even get a harvest.

39:07.740 --> 39:09.020
We're living deep in the mountains.

39:09.780 --> 39:10.740
If we quietly clear a little land,

39:11.180 --> 39:12.140
the authorities won't find out.

39:15.100 --> 39:16.060
Don't believe me? Just try it.

39:16.740 --> 39:18.460
Even if you live deeper
in the mountains,

39:19.060 --> 39:20.500
they'll still find you when they want to

39:20.740 --> 39:21.660
collect taxes and conscript labor.

39:24.220 --> 39:24.820
But

39:25.860 --> 39:26.620
that's not how it should be.

39:37.780 --> 39:38.780
With land this good

39:39.540 --> 39:40.500
and rain this plentiful,

39:42.020 --> 39:43.140
all that hard work

39:45.300 --> 39:46.620
should be enough to keep people fed.

40:27.460 --> 40:29.940
Du Ping,
Transport Commissioner of Lingnan.

40:32.820 --> 40:33.540
Pei Xuanming,

40:34.860 --> 40:37.300
Director of the Bureau of Operations
in the Ministry of War.

40:38.340 --> 40:40.020
Wang Heling, Vice Minister of Revenue.

40:41.380 --> 40:42.180
Wang Heling...

40:44.500 --> 40:46.660
Cheng An, Chamberlain
of the Eastern Palace.

40:48.860 --> 40:50.580
Cheng An, Chamberlain
of the Eastern Palace.

40:52.100 --> 40:53.340
- Director of the Bureau of Opera...
- Yan Shang.

40:54.020 --> 40:54.380
Yan Shang?

40:59.580 --> 40:59.940
Yan Shang.

41:01.620 --> 41:02.020
Yan Shang!

41:07.780 --> 41:08.460
Wenji?

41:13.860 --> 41:14.580
I'm sorry.

41:16.060 --> 41:17.940
The things you asked me
to deliver to your father...

41:18.780 --> 41:19.260
I...

41:20.900 --> 41:22.180
No need to explain that now.

41:26.540 --> 41:26.860
Shang,

41:27.820 --> 41:28.900
I don't have much time in here.

41:29.940 --> 41:31.500
How should I plead for you
before His Majesty?

41:33.260 --> 41:33.780
Tell me.

41:38.540 --> 41:39.060
Wenji.

41:40.180 --> 41:41.780
Could you get me paper and brush?

41:58.580 --> 42:03.420
(Yingxiang, twenty entries,
Huai collection.)

42:15.500 --> 42:18.620
(Eight hundred guan spent on Fei's
techniques and armor supplies.)

42:30.980 --> 42:33.060
(Three hundred guan remaining.
Check the accounts from previous years.)

42:39.340 --> 42:42.900
(Actual labor and material cost
eight hundred guan.)

42:56.740 --> 42:58.420
(Fifty dan of grain in storage. Cao
reports that the rat problem has eased.)

44:03.340 --> 44:03.860
Wanyao?

44:12.660 --> 44:13.380
Greetings, Father.

44:14.460 --> 44:15.060
What is it?

44:15.780 --> 44:17.660
I'd like to ask you for a favor.

44:20.740 --> 44:22.140
You're a smart girl.

44:23.140 --> 44:24.340
You know it's impossible.

44:25.140 --> 44:26.300
Why even ask?

44:27.260 --> 44:28.860
I wouldn't ask for something impossible.

44:29.740 --> 44:31.020
I'd never put you on the spot, Father.

44:32.740 --> 44:33.420
Let's hear it.

44:34.660 --> 44:35.460
Yan Shang

44:36.100 --> 44:36.860
is useless,

44:37.500 --> 44:38.300
mediocre,

44:38.780 --> 44:39.580
and unfit for service.

44:40.220 --> 44:42.140
I ask you to banish him from Sheng'an.

44:46.420 --> 44:47.140
You're willing to let him go?

44:47.700 --> 44:48.740
Even the most favored male favorite

44:49.860 --> 44:51.220
eventually loses his appeal.

44:51.980 --> 44:52.540
Besides,

44:53.060 --> 44:55.260
he's caused me more than enough trouble.

44:58.380 --> 44:59.420
Can you really let him go?

44:59.740 --> 45:00.340
Yes.

45:01.820 --> 45:02.860
Father, please send him away.

45:03.420 --> 45:04.460
Keep him out of the palace forever.

45:05.300 --> 45:05.860
And forbid him

45:06.340 --> 45:07.980
from ever setting foot
in Sheng'an again.

45:18.300 --> 45:22.980
(Next Episode Preview)

45:23.060 --> 45:23.540
Stop!

45:24.220 --> 45:24.700
Move!

45:26.380 --> 45:26.860
Yan Shang.

45:27.860 --> 45:28.940
What did I tell you?

45:29.300 --> 45:30.420
Why did you lie to me?

45:30.940 --> 45:33.140
I've always despised betrayal
above all else.

45:39.640 --> 45:42.933
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:45.618 --> 45:50.534
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:52.728 --> 45:58.573
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:59.073 --> 46:04.299
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:07.068 --> 46:11.859
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:12.695 --> 46:18.774
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:20.575 --> 46:23.725
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:23.725 --> 46:25.373
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:25.425 --> 46:29.149
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:29.527 --> 46:34.193
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:34.812 --> 46:38.853
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:39.344 --> 46:41.459
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:41.499 --> 46:48.445
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:49.208 --> 46:52.661
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:52.841 --> 46:55.986
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:56.425 --> 47:03.062
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:03.459 --> 47:05.497
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:05.497 --> 47:07.973
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:08.011 --> 47:10.480
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:10.684 --> 47:17.571
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:17.883 --> 47:21.154
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:21.459 --> 47:24.632
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:24.956 --> 47:28.382
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:28.615 --> 47:31.840
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:32.171 --> 47:38.967
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:39.336 --> 47:41.398
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:41.399 --> 47:43.902
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:43.949 --> 47:46.287
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:46.518 --> 47:53.353
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:53.702 --> 47:55.320
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:55.450 --> 47:57.246
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:57.603 --> 48:00.620
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:00.660 --> 48:01.987
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
